# Read by `xerj autoindex` alongside .gitignore. The corpus is data/ and the
# claims/ table generated from it; docs/ explains them. Skipped here:
# model transcripts and grades from the eval runs
eval/runs/
# a frozen copy of data/ for the tests; it would duplicate every hit
tests/corpus/
# AI-drafted trees awaiting a human audit; not part of the corpus
drafts/*
!drafts/README.md
# the development record: reviews, audits, paper notes and translations;
# none of it is checked against the project's published goals
notes/*
!notes/README.md
poetry.lock
